        <mxCell id="WghqGNhiQ42wkCp4piQy-111" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(29, 29, 29); font-family: ServiceNowSans, Gilroy, arial; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;REQUIREMENT:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(29, 29, 29); font-family: ServiceNowSans, Gilroy, arial; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;As a member of the Cloud Dimensions CMDB implementation team, use CI Class Manager to configure a static reconciliation rule for the Windows Server (&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 12px; padding: 2px 4px; color: rgb(199, 37, 78); background-color: rgb(249, 242, 244); border-radius: 3px;&quot;&gt;cmdb_ci_win_server&lt;/code&gt;) class that enforces the following behavior:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; color: rgb(29, 29, 29); font-family: ServiceNowSans, Gilroy, arial; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; list-style-position: inside;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A Windows Server CI with a discovery source of LANDesk &lt;strong style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;can&lt;/strong&gt; be updated by ServiceNow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A Windows Server CI with a discovery source of ServiceNow &lt;strong style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;cannot&lt;/strong&gt; be updated by LANDesk.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="190" width="560" x="-510" y="3660" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
